  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting peace in the Tigray region of Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The actions seeks to establish mechanisms and platforms to address key drivers of conflict at the federal, subnational, and local levels in the Tigray region of Ethiopia. It aims to do so by a) supporting efforts to advance the implementation of CoHA; b) strengthening capacities of and cooperation among key political and society actors in Tigray; and c) supporting the piloting of inclusive local infrastructures for peace, which enable participatory resolution of conflicts.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
